756, PubMed:25931126). Known substrates include GALNS, ARSA, STS and ARSE (PubMed:12757706, PubMed:15657036, PubMed:15907468)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}